# ==========================================
# TechEnsureX — Environment Variables
# ==========================================
# This repo has two apps, each with its own env file. Copy the relevant
# example into place and fill in real values — never commit the copies.
#
#   backend/.env.example  -> backend/.env
#   frontend/.env.example -> frontend/.env
#
# See README.md for the full list of variables and what each one is for.
